{"type":"message","id":"cd327577","parentId":"28f05a4f","timestamp":"2026-03-30T14:11:21.858Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，A50期货收盘价应该是14,567（根据东方财富数据，收盘-0.34%）。这比之前我记录的14,640略低。\n\n让我更新持仓状态并生成每日报告。注意到：\n- A50期货收盘：14,567（-0.34%）\n- 上证指数收盘：3,923.29（+0.24%）\n\n不过之前我在晚盘扫描中记录的是14,640，考虑到这是新加坡A50期货的收盘价，可能略有不同。让我更新一下当前价格，然后生成每日报告。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ay34cp5aud73_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/paper-trading/portfolio.json","oldText":"      \"current_price\": 100.98,\n      \"position_value\": 2524.50,\n      \"pnl\": 24.50,\n      \"pnl_pct\": \"0.98%\",\n      \"stop_loss\": 95,\n      \"take_profit\": 110,\n      \"entry_time\": \"2026-03-23T07:16:00+08:00\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-03-30T18:10:00+08:00\",\n      \"signal\": \"A股超跌反弹 - 强信号\",\n      \"reasoning\": \"上证指数RSI超卖，3900-3920点强支撑 + 上证指数上涨0.24%报3923点\",\n      \"risk_pct\": 5,\n      \"leverage\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"持仓中 - 盈利中\",\n      \"sse_index\": 14640,\n      \"alert\": \"A50期货今日开盘跌0.86%后回升，报14640点\",\n      \"daily_change\": \"+0.86%\",\n      \"index_close\": 14640","newText":"      \"current_price\": 100.49,\n      \"position_value\": 2512.25,\n      \"pnl\": 12.25,\n      \"pnl_pct\": \"0.49%\",\n      \"stop_loss\": 95,\n      \"take_profit\": 110,\n      \"entry_time\": \"2026-03-23T07:16:00+08:00\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-03-30T22:00:00+08:00\",\n      \"signal\": \"A股超跌反弹 - 强信号\",\n      \"reasoning\": \"上证指数RSI超卖，3900-3920点强支撑 + 收盘上涨0.24%报3923点\",\n      \"risk_pct\": 5,\n      \"leverage\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"持仓中 - 盈利中\",\n      \"sse_index\": 14567,\n      \"alert\": \"A50期货收盘报14567点，跌0.34%\",\n      \"daily_change\": \"-0.34%\",\n      \"index_close\": 14567"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":1953,"output":757,"cacheRead":51069,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTo